# Debugging

1. Reproduce reliably; record exact inputs and observed vs expected output.
2. List ranked hypotheses and the evidence that would separate them.
3. Bisect (`git bisect`, binary-search inputs, toggle components) instead of guessing.
4. Fix the root cause, not the symptom; add a regression test that fails without the fix.
